## Hints

- M1: the ACF of (A−B) is usually small (the market cancels) — the
  correction may be small; that is the paired design paying off.
- M3: "how many |t|>2 by noise" ≈ 50 × 0.0455 — but simulate it,
  don't trust the formula; then BH.
- M5: the 40 variations is the family; the 21-day overlap is the
  correction; the t=2.8 needs both before it means anything.
